WEBVTT

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.480
(Hwang In Youp)

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:14.450
(Lee Hye Ri)

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:21.730
(Baek Sung Chul, Lee Yul Eum)

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:38.610
(Dream To You)

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:40.110
(All people, events, and backgrounds are fictional.) (This drama includes footage created using AI.)

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:42.110
(Children and animals were filmed under strict safety guidelines.)

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:09.310
What was that?

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.110
I should be asking you that.

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:18.250
Joo Yi Jae, are you crazy?

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.090
What's with you, Joo Yi Jae?

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:25.020
- Forget it. Stop following me. - Joo Yi Jae, you'll get soaked.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:27.960
Okay. I won't walk with you, so just take the umbrella.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:30.260
- Just take it... What? - No thanks.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.860
You're really going to catch a cold.

00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:35.170
It's none of your business if I catch a cold.

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:39.970
(Episode 5)

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.080
You're here?

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:49.050
Yes.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:53.050
- "You're here?" - Sorry. Pretend it never happened.

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.750
It happened. How can we pretend it didn't?

00:01:56.320 --> 00:01:58.320
I must've lost my mind while writing the kiss scene.

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:00.490
But you didn't write it.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:03.230
I must've lost my mind trying to write it.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:06.430
But actually, it's for the best.

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.230
We had to clear the air at some point anyway.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.440
- Clear the air? About what? - I had to confirm how I felt.

00:02:15.170 --> 00:02:16.540
Now that we're working together,

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.180
We can't let personal feelings get in the way.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:20.580
So?

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:22.410
And did you find your answer?

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:26.680
The kiss scene needs to be written, but we shouldn't have done that.

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:31.690
Look at me and say it.

00:02:32.290 --> 00:02:33.490
What? Look at what?

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.830
I said, look at me.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.799
Spending every day together, I was confused about my feelings.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:42.299
You know, you were always around, so I couldn't help but look at you,

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.340
And you got on my mind. That's why it happened.

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.809
Well, I'll make sure nothing like this happens again.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:48.910
I'm sorry if I made you uncomfortable.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:51.910
If that's your answer,

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.710
I don't want your apology.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.380
We don't have to share our every raw emotion.

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.150
So from now on,

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.220
You deal with your feelings yourself.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.490
Don't use me to figure them out.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.590
Acting like this is so childish.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.730
We're not 18 anymore.

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:18.170
Fine. I can do the whole "American style" thing.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:21.070
The kiss scene needs to be written, but we shouldn't have done that.

00:03:21.610 --> 00:03:22.610
"Clear the air?"

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:25.880
Then why did she kiss me?

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:26.979
Spending every day together,

00:03:26.980 --> 00:03:29.350
- I was confused about my feelings. - So I was taken advantage of?

00:03:36.290 --> 00:03:37.560
- Joo Yi Jae. - What?

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.420
Go home.

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:46.830
You think I won't leave when you tell me to?

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.600
Unbelievable, this guy. Who's being childish now?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.540
I...

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:56.440
I'm leaving. This is so petty.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:07.250
Hey. I was going to leave anyway. I'm leaving because I want to.

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:41.590
Hey.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.590
What are you doing here?

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:45.620
Su Bin told me to come get you.

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.260
He said it's dangerous at night and I should protect you.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:50.500
That's ridiculous.

00:04:50.960 --> 00:04:54.000
Right? He worries about the strangest things.

00:04:56.070 --> 00:04:57.070
I'll protect you.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.040
Are you insane?

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:03.710
- So, what are you going to do now? - What do you mean?

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:05.680
Aren't you coming home for good?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:11.080
- Well... - "Well?" Then why are you here?

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.350
Where's Mom?

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:14.020
At the store.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:17.260
You go on ahead.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:19.360
- Why? - Just go in.

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:31.340
(Jaejae Noodles)

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.480
Hello.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.680
It's amazing how none of that spills, right?

00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:41.980
Gosh, look at that.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.680
Who is she? She's so good. She's amazing.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.020
Thank you.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.320
She's so cool.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.860
She's so nimble for her size.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:57.760
Gosh, there she goes. Quick, catch it.

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:01.400
(What should I do?)

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:16.980
Mom.

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:20.890
I'm hungry.

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:32.730
I said I can eat carrots now.

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.700
You're not eating them because you want to.

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.440
Don't force yourself to eat things you don't like.

00:06:38.340 --> 00:06:40.400
You, with your bad leg, climbed a mountain.

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:43.110
You, who's scared of water, fell into the ocean.

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:45.680
And you smiled while eating food you can't stand...

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:49.050
I just couldn't stand watching you like that.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.050
It broke my heart.

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.260
(Savings Account: Joo Yi Jae)

00:07:03.830 --> 00:07:05.260
If you don't like something, just say so.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.600
Every day, just do whatever you want.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:10.900
What would make me happy today? What would make me happy tomorrow?

00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:15.340
Live like that from now on.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.710
Don't think about me,

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:19.680
And don't think about Yeong Jae either.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:25.280
- Mom. - Close your mouth. You'll spit.

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:34.060
A director's job is mostly done by sitting down somewhere, right?

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.000
Well, that's good then.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.370
But, Yi Jae.

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.510
If you decided to work with him,

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:56.650
Shouldn't you tell him about that?

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.120
This is for your own good.

00:08:01.150 --> 00:08:02.319
When you hide things,

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.720
It tends to make you act out in strange ways.

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:46.460
Ma'am.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.200
Ma'am.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:08:58.180
Ma'am.

00:08:58.840 --> 00:08:59.840
Ma'am.

00:09:00.610 --> 00:09:03.180
Ma'am, are you okay? Ma'am.

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:05.850
Ma'am.

00:09:05.851 --> 00:09:07.080
(Woo General Hospital)

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.789
Fortunately, thanks to the quick response,

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:10.220
She's past the worst of it.

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:15.590
It was hypoglycaemic shock. Given her age,

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.800
We'd like to keep her for a few days to monitor her,

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.230
And I'd also recommend we run some tests to find the cause.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:21.830
Okay, thank you, Doctor.

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:29.870
Hey.

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:31.880
You don't remember me?

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:35.150
(Specialist in Internal Medicine, Lee Mi Hyeon)

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:38.720
Lee Mi Hyeon?

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.920
Great. Great. Great expression.

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.190
Hey.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:48.760
You looked good on TV,

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:50.060
But you've gotten even more handsome.

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:51.730
Hey, you look like a celebrity.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:53.200
Have you been well?

00:09:54.060 --> 00:09:55.499
I never thought I'd see you here.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.200
Well, as you can see, this is how I'm doing.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:01.209
I heard you came here.

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:03.640
I heard you stopped by my mother's restaurant for a meal?

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:05.609
- I did? - Didn't you go...

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:06.680
To A Lavish Feast with Yi Jae?

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.479
Right. Isn't it Jin Su's mom's restaurant,

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:11.350
- right? - Gosh.

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.120
Well...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:16.120
Jin Su's mom is my mother-in-law.

00:10:18.020 --> 00:10:19.060
- What? - Yes.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:22.830
- So, you and Jin Su... - Yes.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.430
- Okay. - Yes. What?

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.130
- Hey, can't you drive any faster? - Hurry up and run, will you?

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:32.799
- I think the makeup is a bit much. - Ready.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:33.800
No matter how much I think about it...

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.840
- Is that what happened? - That's what happened.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:42.950
- Mi Hyeon, hold on a second. - Okay, okay. I should get going.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:45.520
Gosh, right. About Jong Seon...

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:47.650
She's definitely going to be stubborn and refuse to be admitted.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:51.390
- Talk some sense into her. I'll go. - Okay. Take care.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.460
Okay.

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:56.290
Jin Su and...

00:10:57.430 --> 00:10:58.500
Mi Hyeon.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.670
Next, we will present the Community Service Award...

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:07.000
For this year. Mok Gong Hui, congratulations.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.510
Please welcome him with a big round of applause.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:10.670
(Sim Yu Geon)

00:11:10.740 --> 00:11:11.880
(Same Name, Different People)

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.380
(Theater Actor, Professor, Entrepreneur)

00:11:13.910 --> 00:11:14.910
What is this?

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:16.880
Why isn't a profile showing up?

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.520
Hey, what are you doing? Everyone is watching us.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.760
How much time is left on my contract?

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.020
Why do you ask? You're just going to renew it anyway.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.590
Stop worrying about pointless things...

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.530
And focus on your meeting with Director Kim.

00:11:33.230 --> 00:11:35.000
I don't know anything.

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:38.340
My contract gets renewed and my next project is chosen...

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:39.400
Without me even knowing.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:44.010
It's so much easier for you. You just take what I give you. Gosh.

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:46.040
Sometimes I wish I were my own daughter.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.680
Mom.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:54.080
Even though I've never raised a child myself,

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.950
I've played the role of a mother many times.

00:11:56.850 --> 00:11:59.060
If you just keep shoving food in before they can even digest,

00:11:59.520 --> 00:12:00.520
The kid will throw up.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:02.560
What do you mean by that?

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.400
Our next awardee is from Top Line Entertainment,

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:09.199
- CEO Ahn Soo Hee. Let's have... - We'll talk later.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.429
A big round of applause.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:13.340
Ahn Soo Hee has been making consistent donations,

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:15.670
And she will also be serving as the promotional ambassador...

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:17.980
- for our club. - Thank you.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.380
There are many people here...

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.950
Who have given more generously than I have,

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.450
So I feel humbled to receive such an award.

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:29.590
The truth is, the reason I've been able to...

00:12:29.650 --> 00:12:31.660
Consistently donate for nearly ten years...

00:12:32.860 --> 00:12:34.730
Is because of my daughter, who is here with me today,

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.160
Ha Na.

00:12:38.030 --> 00:12:40.100
Ha Na. Thank you.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:00.479
Ha Na was filming today.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.490
But she came to congratulate me on my award.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:05.420
She just stopped by for a moment. Isn't she the sweetest?

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.160
In the future...

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:15.200
- Hello, I brought the laundry. - Okay.

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:19.540
Sir, I'm very sorry. There's a note saying the shirt...

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:22.110
- has some permanent stain on it. - It's fine.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.810
- Thank you. - Thank you.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:47.630
(010-0895-3717)

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:52.840
Don't worry. Laundry service. Sorry. Excuse me.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:56.140
Do you want to go out with me?

00:14:10.020 --> 00:14:12.020
Why are you drinking in the middle of the day?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.490
What does time matter?

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:16.659
When I get off work in the morning,

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:17.900
I day drink. Simple as that.

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:21.000
This brings back memories.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:25.540
Hey, you should date someone new before you turn 30.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.770
This is a really great opportunity for you.

00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:29.969
Even if you don't find the one,

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.640
It'll be great publicity for your online store.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:32.980
But still...

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:35.050
How could you ask me to be on the show?

00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:37.820
Wait, are you still not over me?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:41.150
We dated for 3 months, and we broke up 3 years ago.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:43.920
That's really harsh.

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:46.120
Just do it for me once. Okay?

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:51.030
Come on, just appear on our show, "Love Chain," one time.

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:56.800
Who is it?

00:14:58.770 --> 00:14:59.770
Hello.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.640
This is Seo In Wook.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:03.240
Sorry, who?

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.980
From the hotel. The shirt.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.510
- The lipstick. - What?

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.880
The one you asked to date.

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:14.450
Do you want to go out with me?

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:15.990
Yes, baby.

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:18.690
Who was that?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.260
- Hey, you should go. - What?

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:22.330
I said, go.

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:28.230
Choi Sa Rang, don't ever contact me again.

00:15:33.470 --> 00:15:35.140
- Hello. - Yes.

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:36.710
Do you want to come here?

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:50.650
It's still early evening. Are you sure?

00:15:51.260 --> 00:15:52.260
Of course.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:00.560
So, should I keep you company? Or...

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:02.370
Should I get drunk with you?

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:06.800
Let's get drunk.

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:20.350
Something with a clean acidity and a distinct minerality.

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:21.790
The Dolce Vigna, this one.

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:24.690
The 2014 Vino, please. Thank you.

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.490
I'm not sure when it started for me, either.

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:32.130
The drinks just go down so smoothly.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.959
Like a chicken just flutters and flies off.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:35.829
- It happens. - That's what I thought.

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:36.870
That's right.

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.540
So this was to cast me for a dating show?

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.680
And you're the writer, Choi Sa Rang?

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:47.280
Yes. Well, our producer is the one...

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.350
Who was the producer of "Crazy Romance."

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.880
You know it, right? The one that was number one in buzz.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:53.750
I've never heard of it.

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:56.990
But is that how you normally cast people?

00:16:57.890 --> 00:17:01.460
No, normally we take applications or send DMs,

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:06.430
But you and I, what are we? Shall we call it fate?

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.600
So if I'm on the show, can I keep seeing you?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.009
Of course. We'll probably be stuck together...

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.240
For two weeks until you're sick of me.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.180
- And if I don't? - Then today will be the last time.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:22.480
That would be a bit...

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.480
Of a shame, wouldn't it?

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.890
Why did you contact me?

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:07.690
Because I was curious.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:11.660
About a woman who asks a guy to date her the moment they meet.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.500
I was curious too.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:15.670
About what you're like when you date, In Wook.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:36.250
What is Woo Su Bin thinking? What time is it?

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:41.829
Hey, where are you?

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.160
Do you know how many times I've called you?

00:18:43.530 --> 00:18:44.829
You're supposed to tell me...

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:45.900
When you're coming or where you're going.

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:48.170
- We agreed to share everything. - Sorry.

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:50.800
Jong Seon collapsed.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:55.170
- I was rushing to the hospital. - What? Is she okay?

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.870
She tweaked her back a little,

00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.979
But they said she should be admitted for more tests.

00:19:00.980 --> 00:19:01.980
Okay.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.580
I'm sorry, but...

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:09.420
I think you'll have to work by yourself today.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:12.690
So you're not coming home tonight?

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:15.430
Well, I'm not sure yet.

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:16.890
Which hospital is it?

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:22.670
My father's hospital.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:27.140
(Director Woo Cheol Gyu, Specialist of Cardiology)

00:19:58.340 --> 00:19:59.340
Okay.

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:00.699
I'm going to stop by Jong Seon's house...

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:02.170
To grab some things she'll need.

00:20:03.110 --> 00:20:04.209
You must not have been able to grab anything...

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:05.210
Since you left in such a hurry.

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:08.850
Yes. What's the room number?

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.880
Hey. Hey. Did you hear the news?

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.820
Director Woo is our Director's son, apparently.

00:20:16.890 --> 00:20:19.389
- Really? The Director... - Good morning.

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:20.760
- Good morning. - Good morning.

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:25.430
(Nurses' Station)

00:20:26.230 --> 00:20:27.430
What's going on?

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:30.670
It's probably because of your son, Director.

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:35.470
- What about my son? - He came to the hospital yesterday.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:40.440
The rumour that Director Woo is your son spread like wildfire.

00:20:41.110 --> 00:20:44.480
Come on, Director. When you have such an amazing son,

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:46.920
You could brag about him at least once, don't you think?

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:47.980
If it had been me,

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.749
I would've put him in the hospital's promotional videos.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.660
I would've plastered his photos everywhere. Seriously.

00:20:53.720 --> 00:20:54.720
Congratulations.

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.990
Well, he is impressive, though.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:01.930
But still, it's not something to make such a big deal about.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.000
Let's all just keep it quiet.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.040
He...

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:08.810
Doesn't like a lot of fuss.

00:21:09.840 --> 00:21:10.840
Yes, sir.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.580
But...

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:17.080
Did they say why he came to the hospital?

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:27.760
Ms. Park Jong Seon.

00:21:28.860 --> 00:21:29.860
My goodness.

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.930
- Gosh. You don't have to get up. - Gosh.

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:35.570
How are you feeling?

00:21:36.200 --> 00:21:38.440
Yes, I'm all right.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:44.640
Gosh, what brings a busy man like you all the way here, Director?

00:21:45.140 --> 00:21:47.710
I heard about how much you helped my son.

00:21:47.940 --> 00:21:51.310
- I had to come and thank you. - Gosh, it was nothing.

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:55.750
- Su Bin's the one who saved me. - Gosh, is that so?

00:21:57.250 --> 00:22:00.290
By the way, where did Su Bin go?

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:02.730
Maybe he went to meet Yi Jae? She said she was coming.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:04.730
Okay, yes.

00:22:06.200 --> 00:22:09.770
I'll make sure you're well taken care of.

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:11.530
Gosh, thank you so much.

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:21.540
(Laboratory Medicine, IT Department and Nurses Department)

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:25.080
The doors are opening.

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:05.090
(Auto)

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:06.860
(Ventilation Fan)

00:23:07.360 --> 00:23:08.360
(Power)

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:09.660
(Under Maintenance)

00:23:30.580 --> 00:23:32.220
I'm sorry.

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:36.950
Please forgive me.

00:23:46.560 --> 00:23:48.330
Please forgive me.

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:07.280
If you were so determined to sever our family ties,

00:24:09.220 --> 00:24:11.960
You should've run so far away I couldn't reach you.

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:13.920
And you only made it...

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:15.760
Here?

00:24:16.660 --> 00:24:18.290
It was to come back here.

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:22.230
So I could stop running away.

00:24:28.070 --> 00:24:29.470
(Outpatient Clinic)

00:24:36.680 --> 00:24:38.780
(Under Maintenance)

00:24:45.620 --> 00:24:47.360
(Locker Room for Men)

00:24:57.800 --> 00:24:59.040
- Gosh. - There's someone inside.

00:25:16.350 --> 00:25:17.420
It's okay.

00:25:18.860 --> 00:25:19.860
It's okay.

00:25:22.960 --> 00:25:23.990
It's okay.

00:26:24.120 --> 00:26:25.720
I'm right here, Woo Su Bin.

00:26:29.730 --> 00:26:30.730
You don't have to come out.

00:26:32.130 --> 00:26:33.130
Just...

00:26:33.460 --> 00:26:34.460
Be aware that I'm here.

00:26:48.240 --> 00:26:51.010
- Joo Yi Jae. About before... - I heard you met Mi Hyeon.

00:26:54.050 --> 00:26:55.720
I haven't seen her since her wedding.

00:26:57.150 --> 00:26:58.860
I even filmed their wedding video, you know.

00:27:02.290 --> 00:27:03.660
- Really? - Yes.

00:27:04.630 --> 00:27:06.630
Has it been about three years?

00:27:07.500 --> 00:27:08.670
I should still have it somewhere.

00:27:09.370 --> 00:27:10.470
I'll show it to you next time.

00:27:12.570 --> 00:27:16.370
Sung Chan must've grown a lot. How old would he be now?

00:27:18.410 --> 00:27:19.610
Is he starting school next year?

00:27:22.410 --> 00:27:24.010
You said they got married three years ago.

00:27:25.010 --> 00:27:26.150
They had the baby first.

00:27:26.820 --> 00:27:29.290
If you see him, you'd know he's Kim Jin Su's son.

00:27:29.790 --> 00:27:31.450
He's basically a Kim Jin Su Jr.

00:27:33.760 --> 00:27:35.860
Gosh, right. I heard today...

00:27:36.290 --> 00:27:39.900
That Jin Su quit his perfectly good job...

00:27:39.960 --> 00:27:40.960
To write web novels.

00:27:41.760 --> 00:27:43.330
What was his pen name again?

00:27:44.670 --> 00:27:45.840
Jinsueocheonga.

00:27:46.700 --> 00:27:49.039
What a grandiose pen name.

00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:50.410
I heard that he doesn't earn a lot of money.

00:27:51.570 --> 00:27:53.479
But I heard he does the housework and childcare...

00:27:53.480 --> 00:27:55.910
Without complaining, so she just lets him be.

00:27:59.750 --> 00:28:00.750
That's so like Jin Su.

00:28:08.990 --> 00:28:10.360
Thanks, Joo Yi Jae.

00:28:42.890 --> 00:28:43.890
(Oh Ha Na must be banned from acting in romantic comedies.)

00:28:43.891 --> 00:28:45.129
(Her acting is so awkward.)

00:28:45.130 --> 00:28:46.359
(Sang Yeon is carrying the show alone.)

00:28:46.360 --> 00:28:47.560
(Is that a romance? It's a thriller.)

00:28:51.570 --> 00:28:54.440
Stop reading the comments.

00:28:57.640 --> 00:28:59.110
Do I really seem that bad to you?

00:28:59.280 --> 00:29:00.680
"Bad?"

00:29:00.940 --> 00:29:02.849
Your looks are overshadowing your acting.

00:29:02.850 --> 00:29:04.210
You're a brilliant actress.

00:29:04.480 --> 00:29:07.620
You've played a killer, a devil, a detective, even a judge.

00:29:07.680 --> 00:29:09.990
You're great at playing everything from good guys to villains.

00:29:10.190 --> 00:29:12.390
Then why am I so bad at romance roles?

00:29:13.320 --> 00:29:16.460
Maybe... It's because you've never been in love?

00:29:19.200 --> 00:29:21.330
By that logic, does that mean I've killed someone before?

00:29:22.770 --> 00:29:23.800
Have you?

00:29:26.700 --> 00:29:29.610
I'm kidding.

00:29:37.410 --> 00:29:38.410
Ha Na.

00:29:39.580 --> 00:29:43.490
When you're in love, it shows on your face.

00:29:44.090 --> 00:29:46.619
Your eyes, your nose, your lips...

00:29:46.620 --> 00:29:48.220
They're all directed at that person.

00:29:49.060 --> 00:29:50.360
You can't hide it.

00:30:06.010 --> 00:30:07.210
Please turn the car around.

00:30:10.510 --> 00:30:13.080
- Welcome. - Welcome.

00:30:19.860 --> 00:30:20.920
Will you order...

00:30:20.990 --> 00:30:21.990
When the rest of your party gets here?

00:30:23.290 --> 00:30:24.560
One serving of meat, please.

00:30:25.130 --> 00:30:26.530
There's a two-serving minimum.

00:30:31.630 --> 00:30:32.670
What brings you here?

00:30:33.100 --> 00:30:35.610
I just felt like riding a motorcycle.

00:30:38.140 --> 00:30:39.140
When do you get off work?

00:30:40.210 --> 00:30:42.550
I have about an hour left.

00:30:44.380 --> 00:30:45.380
I'll wait.

00:30:46.920 --> 00:30:47.920
Okay.

00:30:53.090 --> 00:30:54.290
Thank you.

00:30:55.320 --> 00:30:56.330
It's pretty.

00:31:00.560 --> 00:31:04.699
- Anyway, why don't you... - What?

00:31:04.700 --> 00:31:05.700
Honestly...

00:31:06.340 --> 00:31:09.910
- Who would turn down Oh Ha Na? - I would.

00:31:10.840 --> 00:31:13.209
But I wonder if she's really never dated anyone.

00:31:13.210 --> 00:31:14.210
Do you think it makes sense?

00:31:15.180 --> 00:31:18.180
That's why so many people say she can't do romance, right?

00:31:18.410 --> 00:31:20.950
Don't you think she'd be boring to date?

00:31:21.320 --> 00:31:24.050
Hey, hey. Look at her eyes. Just look at them.

00:31:24.150 --> 00:31:26.620
Hey, how can you say that after seeing the look in her eyes?

00:31:27.090 --> 00:31:29.689
You can tell she's trouble for men. It's written all over her face.

00:31:29.690 --> 00:31:31.860
Gosh. Exactly.

00:31:31.930 --> 00:31:34.130
Who was that again? Ahn Soo Hee, right?

00:31:34.200 --> 00:31:36.800
As soon as her husband's business failed, she divorced him, right?

00:31:36.970 --> 00:31:39.240
After all that time she spent living the high life as his wife.

00:31:39.300 --> 00:31:41.900
Gosh, she's a heartless jerk. How pathetic.

00:31:42.410 --> 00:31:44.769
Well, they say a daughter inherits her mother's fate.

00:31:44.770 --> 00:31:46.240
The apple doesn't fall far from the tree.

00:31:46.540 --> 00:31:49.349
- Like mother, like daughter. - Gosh, you scared me.

00:31:49.350 --> 00:31:50.980
You're all being pretty loud.

00:31:56.320 --> 00:31:59.290
- Boss, I quit. - Hey, what's going on?

00:31:59.360 --> 00:32:01.220
- What's with him? - Hey, hey.

00:32:09.000 --> 00:32:10.100
Why can't you say anything?

00:32:11.830 --> 00:32:13.639
You were so quick to jump in and help...

00:32:13.640 --> 00:32:14.740
When it came to other people.

00:32:16.470 --> 00:32:18.340
So why do you always run away when it's your own problem?

00:32:20.480 --> 00:32:21.480
- Why? - Gosh.

00:32:26.020 --> 00:32:27.050
It's okay.

00:32:29.090 --> 00:32:30.190
Those people are just...

00:32:31.720 --> 00:32:33.420
The kind of people who can say those things,

00:32:36.460 --> 00:32:38.060
And I'm the kind of person who's supposed to take it.

00:32:53.980 --> 00:32:54.980
Get on.

00:32:56.150 --> 00:32:57.779
Didn't you say you came for a motorcycle ride?

00:32:57.780 --> 00:33:01.320
(010-0125-64...)

00:33:34.580 --> 00:33:38.520
(010-0125-6458)

00:34:00.080 --> 00:34:01.110
Thank you.

00:34:07.980 --> 00:34:09.250
Why aren't you asking?

00:34:10.490 --> 00:34:11.950
About how I found you.

00:34:14.760 --> 00:34:17.190
It doesn't seem like the right time to ask that.

00:34:18.960 --> 00:34:19.960
Well...

00:34:20.760 --> 00:34:22.260
And I don't think you'd answer me anyway.

00:34:23.170 --> 00:34:24.570
I looked you up online.

00:34:27.470 --> 00:34:28.939
But for an actor, how come you don't have...

00:34:28.940 --> 00:34:30.140
A single profile online?

00:34:30.940 --> 00:34:32.110
Then where did you see me?

00:34:33.710 --> 00:34:34.780
On social media.

00:34:36.710 --> 00:34:38.410
When I searched your name,

00:34:38.810 --> 00:34:40.650
A few web dramas...

00:34:41.050 --> 00:34:43.350
And a picture of you serving at a BBQ place came up.

00:34:44.090 --> 00:34:45.550
Those were all taken without your permission.

00:34:47.520 --> 00:34:48.620
Should I sue them for you?

00:34:50.130 --> 00:34:51.130
No.

00:34:53.800 --> 00:34:55.830
But why did you look me up?

00:35:00.400 --> 00:35:01.400
Look,

00:35:02.100 --> 00:35:03.809
It's not fair.

00:35:03.810 --> 00:35:05.310
We're friends,

00:35:05.370 --> 00:35:06.740
But I'm the only one who knows so little about you.

00:35:07.980 --> 00:35:09.780
You looked me up, didn't you?

00:35:10.350 --> 00:35:12.550
If you search for Oh Ha Na, even my fortune comes up.

00:35:13.220 --> 00:35:14.620
It says I'll make a ton of money.

00:35:17.720 --> 00:35:18.720
But...

00:35:19.890 --> 00:35:20.990
It also says that I'm fated to be lonely my whole life.

00:35:26.060 --> 00:35:27.360
I didn't look you up.

00:35:29.500 --> 00:35:32.370
Usually, when we're friends, I would ask in person.

00:35:38.040 --> 00:35:39.040
I see.

00:35:40.240 --> 00:35:41.610
My name is Sim Yu Geon,

00:35:43.410 --> 00:35:44.780
And I'm 29.

00:35:46.420 --> 00:35:47.420
And?

00:35:48.150 --> 00:35:49.150
Our family members are...

00:35:49.920 --> 00:35:51.290
Just my father and me.

00:35:53.620 --> 00:35:55.590
And my hobby is...

00:35:56.290 --> 00:35:57.430
Watching Hong Kong movies?

00:36:01.060 --> 00:36:02.970
The reason I wanted to be an actor...

00:36:03.970 --> 00:36:05.000
Was simply because...

00:36:06.000 --> 00:36:07.569
Kaneshiro Takeshi was so cool.

00:36:07.570 --> 00:36:08.870
- Get away. - Dad.

00:36:08.900 --> 00:36:09.910
Why?

00:36:10.110 --> 00:36:11.540
I, Sim Yu Geon,

00:36:12.610 --> 00:36:14.279
Will become the Kaneshiro Takeshi of South Korea.

00:36:14.280 --> 00:36:16.409
I've also made up my mind too...

00:36:16.410 --> 00:36:18.649
- to wake you up with this net. - Oh, wait.

00:36:18.650 --> 00:36:20.079
- You jerk. - It's cold. So cold.

00:36:20.080 --> 00:36:22.990
My favourite movie is "Chungking Express."

00:36:23.490 --> 00:36:24.990
My favourite line is...

00:36:25.250 --> 00:36:27.389
"If love had an expiry date,"

00:36:27.390 --> 00:36:29.860
"I'd wish for mine to be 10,000 years."

00:36:30.860 --> 00:36:33.060
"If love had an expiry date,"

00:36:34.730 --> 00:36:36.700
"I'd wish for mine..."

00:36:37.200 --> 00:36:38.470
"to be 10,000 years."

00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:40.200
That's my favourite line.

00:36:41.770 --> 00:36:44.869
What? Break up? Hey, you can't break up with me.

00:36:44.870 --> 00:36:47.510
It started with wanting to be Kaneshiro Takeshi.

00:36:47.710 --> 00:36:48.710
Hey! If you want me...

00:36:48.711 --> 00:36:50.179
- But at some point, - to die, I can pretend to die.

00:36:50.180 --> 00:36:52.250
- it became about wanting to act. - Please see this.

00:36:53.450 --> 00:36:57.750
(1st Audition of Alley Story)

00:36:57.820 --> 00:36:59.490
Director. Director.

00:37:00.220 --> 00:37:02.690
Yes, thank you for your work. You can go.

00:37:05.360 --> 00:37:07.530
- Who chose him? - Thank you.

00:37:07.600 --> 00:37:11.200
- Thank you. - Next, Han Dong Min, you may go in.

00:37:12.540 --> 00:37:16.070
But it was hard to even get a chance to audition.

00:37:16.440 --> 00:37:19.040
Hey, get in here. Come on. Let me hit you once.

00:37:21.640 --> 00:37:24.180
Wait, hold on. Hey, what is this?

00:37:25.010 --> 00:37:26.750
- Director Choi? - Yes.

00:37:26.820 --> 00:37:27.820
This is real, right?

00:37:28.380 --> 00:37:31.120
- Give it to me. - No, sir. It's dangerous...

00:37:31.250 --> 00:37:34.920
Can't you see this, Director Choi? The look in their eyes has changed.

00:37:36.690 --> 00:37:37.690
Let's shoot it like this.

00:37:38.790 --> 00:37:41.300
- Ready, set, action. - Gosh.

00:37:52.610 --> 00:37:53.610
Maybe...

00:37:54.810 --> 00:37:57.080
I'll go my whole life without anyone ever knowing my name.

00:38:02.120 --> 00:38:03.190
But even so,

00:38:04.350 --> 00:38:06.120
If my dream had an expiry date,

00:38:06.990 --> 00:38:08.190
I'd want it to be 10,000 years.

00:38:10.290 --> 00:38:11.660
My father told me...

00:38:12.630 --> 00:38:14.260
To just come home...

00:38:15.400 --> 00:38:16.430
If I don't amount to anything in ten years.

00:38:19.870 --> 00:38:21.570
But just like that, ten years have passed.

00:38:24.310 --> 00:38:25.340
Without me amounting to anything.

00:38:28.610 --> 00:38:30.310
What does "amounting to anything" even mean?

00:38:31.450 --> 00:38:33.050
Who gets to set that standard?

00:38:35.250 --> 00:38:36.390
Just go home.

00:38:37.720 --> 00:38:40.190
You can go see your father and then come back, right?

00:38:42.190 --> 00:38:44.660
- That's not what he meant... - I know.

00:38:45.590 --> 00:38:46.600
But...

00:38:47.400 --> 00:38:49.870
I just don't think his words sound all that cold.

00:38:51.770 --> 00:38:54.470
It sounds like he's saying you can come home anytime.

00:38:56.340 --> 00:38:59.210
Like the warm embrace of a parent.

00:39:01.240 --> 00:39:02.610
I'm actually really jealous.

00:39:04.480 --> 00:39:06.050
Jealous?

00:39:11.120 --> 00:39:12.120
Let me...

00:39:12.860 --> 00:39:16.390
Tell you something you won't find if you search for Oh Ha Na online.

00:39:27.370 --> 00:39:31.510
- Is it fun? - I loved being on TV.

00:39:31.910 --> 00:39:33.980
Let Mom make your hair pretty.

00:39:35.010 --> 00:39:36.010
So pretty.

00:39:41.850 --> 00:39:44.920
I have an all-night shoot. Please stay until tomorrow morning.

00:39:45.120 --> 00:39:48.060
- Yes, of course. Have a good shoot. - Mom.

00:39:55.300 --> 00:39:56.500
Should we watch some TV?

00:39:57.430 --> 00:40:00.540
- Okay. - Who does our Ha Na take after?

00:40:00.600 --> 00:40:01.600
You, Mom.

00:40:01.900 --> 00:40:04.469
- Who's this pretty girl? - I was even happier there.

00:40:04.470 --> 00:40:05.670
Oh Ha Na.

00:40:05.910 --> 00:40:07.310
Without realising it was all fake.

00:40:07.880 --> 00:40:11.010
- Right. Our Ha Na is the prettiest. - Ready, action.

00:40:11.380 --> 00:40:14.850
- Ha Na's milk is one of a kind. - Please smile brighter.

00:40:15.450 --> 00:40:18.249
- Ha Na's milk is one of a kind. - Make it prettier.

00:40:18.250 --> 00:40:21.560
- Ha Na's milk is one of a kind. - We'll keep that. Let's go again.

00:40:22.590 --> 00:40:24.630
Cut, cut. That's no good.

00:40:28.200 --> 00:40:31.700
- Get Ha Na some water. - It's fine. You'll spoil her.

00:40:34.370 --> 00:40:35.370
Ha Na.

00:40:35.940 --> 00:40:38.310
Ha Na, what's wrong? Are you going to disappoint me?

00:40:40.910 --> 00:40:41.910
Smile.

00:40:44.910 --> 00:40:46.620
That's it. Ha Na is ready.

00:40:54.660 --> 00:40:56.329
(Ha Na's High School)

00:40:56.330 --> 00:40:57.990
Ha Na's High School.

00:40:58.830 --> 00:40:59.830
Ha Na.

00:41:00.660 --> 00:41:01.660
Good morning.

00:41:02.300 --> 00:41:04.100
I heard you were filming late again last night.

00:41:04.200 --> 00:41:05.200
You must be tired.

00:41:05.870 --> 00:41:06.940
No, I'm fine.

00:41:07.840 --> 00:41:10.940
Our Ha Na is amazing, isn't she? There's nothing she's lacking.

00:41:11.040 --> 00:41:12.270
It makes me jealous.

00:41:13.310 --> 00:41:15.180
But I eventually came to realise it.

00:41:15.640 --> 00:41:19.579
- Thank you. - That my whole world is fake.

00:41:19.580 --> 00:41:20.950
- Yes, teacher. - Yes.

00:41:21.920 --> 00:41:23.090
When should we work on our project?

00:41:23.750 --> 00:41:25.050
- Cut. - Tomorrow?

00:41:25.720 --> 00:41:28.290
Ha Na, great work today. I'll see you at the next shoot.

