Where is Woo Su Bin? Bring him here.

01:00:23.220 --> 01:00:27.560
I'll do the same to him. I'll break his legs.

01:00:28.130 --> 01:00:32.570
Say something. Say something.

01:00:32.930 --> 01:00:34.570
- What would you do for her? - Ma'am, what are you doing?

01:00:34.640 --> 01:00:36.800
What would you do for my Yi Jae? Let go of me.

01:00:36.870 --> 01:00:38.869
I won't let this go. I won't just stand by.

01:00:38.870 --> 01:00:41.180
- Are you all right? - Director, are you all right?

01:00:41.240 --> 01:00:42.380
- Yes, I'm fine. - Yes.

01:00:42.440 --> 01:00:43.440
Good grief.

01:01:28.260 --> 01:01:29.960
Do you think you're a flaw only in my life?

01:01:30.890 --> 01:01:31.890
Didn't you know?

01:01:32.390 --> 01:01:33.960
That you're the one who ruined her life?

01:01:34.030 --> 01:01:35.030
That you crippled her?

01:01:36.460 --> 01:01:37.470
Woo Su Bin.

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:39.070
You are my regret.

01:01:40.030 --> 01:01:41.100
You should go back to that day too,

01:01:41.700 --> 01:01:42.940
And see how I feel.

01:01:45.410 --> 01:01:47.140
What if Mu Gyeom leaves her over this?

01:01:50.850 --> 01:01:52.510
Then she'll never be able to tell him.

01:02:40.430 --> 01:02:42.200
(Dream To You)

01:02:42.300 --> 01:02:44.469
I'm finally done.

01:02:44.470 --> 01:02:46.870
Do you want to grab a drink to celebrate the first draft?

01:02:47.300 --> 01:02:49.000
I'm not planning on staying here.

01:02:49.540 --> 01:02:50.540
I'm getting out of here.

01:02:50.600 --> 01:02:51.610
Gyeongseong Love Song?

01:02:51.940 --> 01:02:54.580
The guy Ha Na was looking for... It was him all along?

01:02:54.980 --> 01:02:56.940
- Hello? - It's me, Director Kang.

01:02:57.180 --> 01:02:58.280
It's a pleasure to meet you.

01:02:58.350 --> 01:03:00.410
How about you save the introductions for after location hunting?

01:03:00.480 --> 01:03:03.250
- Right now? Why am I left out? - Let's just do it this way.

01:03:03.650 --> 01:03:06.419
Who does some jerk from a no-name university...

01:03:06.420 --> 01:03:08.090
- Get out. That's enough. - Hey.

